Subject: Accept the 2012 build of GOG's
 setup_rollercoaster_tycoon2_2.0.0.6.exe

GOG has shipped two installers under this name: 519354792 bytes (known)
and 519393624 bytes, with goggame.dll and GameuxInstallHelper.dll and
its files dated 2012. Both hold the same Triple Thrill Pack game files
(all 2454 of the base and expansion packages match), so the second one
is an alternative with the same provides.

Forwarded: not yet (candidate for Debian)

